{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\ApproveLinks\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Cron/CleanupLinks.php:26 time()",
        "lib/Service/ApiService.php:86 time()",
        "lib/Service/ApiService.php:183 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 3 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Cron/CleanupLinks.php:26 time()",
        "  lib/Service/ApiService.php:86 time()",
        "  lib/Service/ApiService.php:183 time()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocs-unreferenced",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "POST /ocs/v2.php/apps/approve_links/api/{apiVersion}/link  ocs.approve_links.api.generatelink  appinfo/routes.php:23 ocs"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 1 OCS route. OCS is there for clients outside the app, so this is no defect in itself.",
        "  POST /ocs/v2.php/apps/approve_links/api/{apiVersion}/link  ocs.approve_links.api.generatelink  appinfo/routes.php:23 ocs"
      ]
    }
  ],
